  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "塩味が　強い　食材。サンドウィッチに　しっかりとした食べ応えを　求めるなら　欠かせない。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "짠맛이 강한 식재료. 샌드위치에 확실한 포만감을 주고 싶을 때 빠지지 않는다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "鹹味強勁的食材。若希望三明治能帶來飽足感，便少不了它。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un ingrédient au goût très salé. Parfait si l’on veut préparer un Sandwich qui tient vraiment au corps.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Wem nach einem sättigenden Sandwich zumute ist, der sollte auf diese sehr salzige Zutat nicht verzichten.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un ingrediente de fuerte sabor salado fundamental para dar volumen y consistencia a cualquier bocadillo.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un ingrediente molto salato, perfetto per preparare dei panini sostanziosi.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "This very salty ingredient is the thing to add if you want to make your sandwich truly filling.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "塩味が　強い　食材。サンドウィッチに　しっかりとした食べ応えを　求めるなら　欠かせない。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "咸味强烈的食材。如果希望三明治能吃得让人满足，就绝不能少了它。",
